NSS HW-accelerated SQM for IPQ807x (this fork).

Requires: kmod-qca-nss-drv-qdisc, kmod-qca-nss-drv-igs, sqm-scripts-nss.
Discipline: nssfq_codel only (cake/simple.qos software paths are NOT used).

Recommended LuCI settings:
  - Queue discipline: fq_codel
  - Queue setup script: nss-zk.qos
  - Link rates: ~90–95% of real WAN throughput (kbit/s)
  - Advanced (optional): eqdisc_opts / iqdisc_opts → "interval 50ms"
  - Soft offload (firewall flow_offloading / flow_offloading_hw): OFF
    (ECM + NSS own acceleration; SW/HW flow offload fights SQM)

Fork defaults inside this script:
  - codel interval 50ms if not overridden
  - queue limit floor ≥400 packets (higher on multi-hundred Mbps)
  - does not rmmod NSS modules on stop (safer with ECM)
